  "text": "proprium.dominica-vii-post-pentecosten-offertorium",
  "about": "The offertorium of the formulary “7th Sunday after Pentecost” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "As though it were holocausts of rams and bullocks, or thousands of fat lambs, so let our sacrifice be in Your presence today, that it may please You; for those who trust in You cannot be put to shame, O Lord." }
